# The Default Alphaeon Config record holds org-specific values (Client Id,
# Client Key, Base Url override) that admins edit via the Setup UI. Ignoring
# it here keeps `sf project deploy start` from clobbering those values with
# the placeholder content in source. The file stays in the repo so the schema
# and the first-time bootstrap deploy stay self-contained — see
# INSTALLATION.md for the bootstrap workflow.
force-app/main/default/customMetadata/Alphaeon_Config.Default.md-meta.xml
